'''I'll Be Bug (Merciless)''' is the first stage in [[The Queen and the Saint]]. After clearing this [[No Continues]] stage, the player can challenge the [[Continuation Stage]] [[Saintly Sister (Merciless) (Queen and Saint)|Saintly Sister (Merciless)]].

