==Battleground==
*2 [[Professor A.|Professor As]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 143.33~146.67 seconds<sup>4,300f~4,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 14.67~21.33 seconds<sup>440f~640f</sup>.
*1 [[Queen Mother V]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 56~58.67 seconds<sup>1,680f~1,760f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Doge]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Doge]] spawns after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 12~16 seconds<sup>360f~480f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Seeing as [[Saintly Sister (Merciless) (Queen and Saint)|Saintly Sister]] requires very few brain cells to do, focus most of your lineup on Queen Mother V. [[Manic Island Cat]] and [[Roe Cat]] crush this stage, while units like [[Can Can Cat]], [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] and [[Courier Cat]] help for both levels. [[Sharpshooter Saki (Uber Rare Cat)|Sharpshooter Saki]] can also destroy the Professor A.s if you manage to get her inside Queen Mothers blindspot. Curseblast is recommended as your [[Cat Cannon]] to assist against both bosses.

If you have [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]], he demolishes both Queen Mother V's and Papuu's stage, being able to Curse both bosses and remove their main gimmicks. Even without his [[True Form]], he still does a good job against Papuu.

==Trivia==
*I'll Be Bug is likely a reference to the [[wikipedia:Arnold Schwarzenegger|Arnold Schwarzenegger]] quote "I'll be back", which was first used in the acclaimed sci-fi movie ''[[wikipedia:The Terminator|The Terminator]]'' where he portrayed the T-800 Terminator.

